The test font. Committed for the tests, never published (kama.json's `publish.exclude` names tests/), and never part of
a program. It is unmodified, so the OFL's Reserved Font Name clause does not come into play. Until 0.1.0 the tests read
it from the fetched RmlUi tree. RmlUi's Samples are not vendored, so it is committed here.

